  "@walletParkedAuthorizeStillWaiting": {
    "description": "Snackbar when the authorization signed NOTHING and the payment stays saved (not enough spendable balance at this moment, a full one-time-address window, or the wallet's own background pass claimed the row first). MONEY-CRITICAL COPY RULE: this is NOT a failure — never translate it as one. A user who believes the payment failed re-enters it and BOTH send: a double pay. Deliberately promises no retry timing (background retries ride sync passes, which a host may have turned off). Only for a row that was NOT paused — see walletParkedAuthorizeRearmed."
